direction: right
title: Docker / OCI Container Lifecycle State Machine

Created: CREATED State
Running: RUNNING State
Paused: PAUSED State
Stopped: STOPPED (Exit 0)
OOM: OOMKILLED (Exit 137)
Removed: REMOVED

Created -> Running: docker run / start { style.stroke: "#38BDF8" }
Running -> Paused: docker pause { style.stroke: "#F59E0B" }
Paused -> Running: docker unpause { style.stroke: "#10B981" }
Running -> Stopped: docker stop (SIGTERM) { style.stroke: "#94A3B8" }
Running -> OOM: Exceeds memory.max (SIGKILL) { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
Stopped -> Removed: docker rm
OOM -> Removed: docker rm
